---@class aws.ivs.ThumbnailConfiguration
---@field recordingMode? aws.ivs.RecordingMode Thumbnail recording mode. Default: INTERVAL.
---@field targetIntervalSeconds? aws.ivs.TargetIntervalSeconds The targeted thumbnail-generation interval in seconds. This is configurable (and required) only if recordingMode is INTERVAL. Default: 60.
